            "action_name": {
              "value": "Power Dive"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The derhii Strides twice while flying, then makes a Strike with a manufactured weapon. If the derhii moved at least 20 feet from their starting position, the Strike's damage is increases by one die, such as increasing falchion damage to 2d10+7. With a melee attack, the derhii can forgo the extra damage to force the target to fall prone."
            },
